  /* 2026-10-23 overnight (Sam, playtest: "HERE is where there is massive space, a big gap after 'the novelist' and before the walkable
     map"): the hub's links move onto the map, and the line breaks that stood between them stayed behind as empty lines above it.
     Any line break, or any empty block with no named hook in it, lying wholly between the last words and the map is folded away;
     checked again as the page settles. */
