// half-second decay, rings under the typewriter's lead-in pause.
if (window.dssAudio && window.dssAudio.distantBell) window.dssAudio.distantBell();
// Kindle the matching header jewel in sync with the gong. The [header]
// passage (which fills the jewels from $alba) renders BEFORE the line is
// caught — on LINE 1 the (set:) runs in the passage body; on LINE 2/3 it
// runs on a (link:) click — so the jewel can't reflect the new line until
// the next navigation. Light it here so it swells the moment the line lands
// (the .alba-jewel 0.7s transition rides the bell); the next header render
