// ====== THE AFTER-IMAGE (polish loop 2026-09-23) ======
// When a passage is left, a faint copy of it stays on the retina for under a
// second, fading and lifting a few pixels while the new passage waits its
// 0.55s before fading in. Nothing in the copy is live: links become spans,
